---
import ContentPage from '../../components/ContentPage.astro';
import FAQ from '../../components/FAQ.astro';

const faqItems = [
  { question: 'Which counter options are listed?', answer: 'The current counter list includes Default Counter, RedWood Counter, and ElegantWood Counter.' },
  { question: 'How much does the ElegantWood Counter cost?', answer: 'The listed ElegantWood Counter upgrade costs ₱80,000 and shows an upgrade time of 10 minutes.' },
  { question: 'Should I spend all my Cash on a counter upgrade?', answer: 'Keep enough Cash for ingredients and other restaurant needs before confirming a large decoration purchase.' },
];
---
<ContentPage title="Karinderya Counter Upgrades Guide" description="Compare Karinderya counter choices, including the ElegantWood Counter cost and upgrade time." kicker="Decorations guide" intro="Compare counter choices and plan your next restaurant upgrade." parent={{ label: 'Guides', href: '/guides/' }} relatedLinks={[{ label: 'Decorations', href: '/decorations/' }, { label: 'Tiles', href: '/decorations/tiles/' }, { label: 'Furniture', href: '/furniture/' }]} sourceIds={['wiki-decorations']} tableOfContents>
  <h2 id="counter-overview">Counter Overview</h2>
  <p>Counters are part of restaurant customization. The available progression includes the starting Default Counter and upgrade options such as RedWood and ElegantWood.</p>

  <h2 id="counter-options">Counter Options</h2>
  <div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Counter</th><th scope="col">Details</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <tr><th scope="row">Default Counter</th><td>Starting counter option</td></tr>
    <tr><th scope="row">RedWood Counter</th><td>Counter upgrade option</td></tr>
    <tr><th scope="row">ElegantWood Counter</th><td>&#8369;80,000; upgrade time: 10 minutes</td></tr>
  </tbody></table></div>

  <h2 id="how-to-upgrade">How to Upgrade</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open the Counter Upgrade option when it is available.</li>
    <li>Compare the displayed counter choice, cost, and upgrade time.</li>
    <li>Make sure the purchase will not leave the restaurant short on ingredient Cash.</li>
    <li>Confirm the upgrade you want and allow the displayed upgrade time to complete.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2 id="upgrade-tips">Upgrade Tips</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Plan expensive visual upgrades around essential grocery and equipment purchases.</li>
    <li>Check the selected counter name before confirming.</li>
    <li>Use the Decorations page to compare counters with other customization choices.</li>
  </ul>

  <FAQ items={faqItems} />
</ContentPage>
